      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12112868::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating contains increased crystalline-amorphous structures and intermetallic wear-resistant phases.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12112868::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting coating contains carbide, boride, and nitride phases.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12112868::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The metallic bonding phase ensures excellent adhesion to the steel substrate.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12112868::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dispersed WC, B4C, and TiB2 reinforcements increase microhardness and reduce abrasion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12112868::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Synergy between the bonding and reinforcing phases distributes loads, resists deformation, and thereby minimizes wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized coating increases surface microhardness relative to untreated carbon steel.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12112868::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coated surface can approach a microhardness of 15.0 GPa.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC12112868::page::001"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
